6	/**
7	 * Assigns the new owner's {@code membershipNumber}, formatted
8	 * {@code <customerCode>-M<YY>}: the owner's customer code, {@code -M}, and the last two
9	 * digits of the registration date year (e.g. {@code SMI-0007-M26}). Runs after
10	 * {@link AssignOwnerCustomerCode} (so the customer code exists) and after the registration
11	 * date has been set, and before {@link SaveOwner} persists the number.
12	 */
13	public class AssignOwnerMembershipNumber {
